 "remarks": "Move-In Ready & Effortless Living at Riverturn. Welcome to Riverturn, a sought-after community where comfort, privacy, and convenience come together in this beautifully maintained multi-level townhouse. Light-filled and inviting, the home offers spacious living areas and a layout designed for today's lifestyle. The main level features gleaming hardwood floors, a generous living and dining area with a cozy gas fireplace, and glass sliders opening to a private deck. The updated eat-in kitchen features granite countertops, a bay window, newer stainless steel appliances, and ample cabinetry, while a powder room completes the main floor. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite offers vaulted ceilings, a skylight, two generous closets, and a private ensuite bath. The second bedroom is equally inviting, with direct access to the hall bath. A versatile loft provides space for a home office, gym, or additional living area, plus walk-in storage. The lower level adds flexibility with a large recreation/family room, laundry, and direct access to the one-car garage. Riverturn's prime location puts shopping, dining, and the Merritt Parkway within easy reach, just minutes from downtown Stamford. This is low-maintenance condo living at its best-with no outdoor upkeep. Beautifully maintained, exceptionally convenient, pet friendly, and truly move-in ready-this Riverturn townhouse is one not to miss.",
